# Gutless Plunderer: "Raid -- When this creature enters, if you attacked this turn, look at the top three cards of your library.
# You may put one of those cards back on top of your library. Put the rest into your graveyard." Bot1 attacks with Memnite on
# turn 3, then casts the Plunderer after combat (CR 508.1, 603.4): the top three cards are Lightning Bolt, Ponder and Forest;
# the Forest goes back on top and the other two go to the graveyard, the fourth card, an Island, stays in the library
# (CR 701.20a) - as does everything of Bot2's (its one graveyard card is the discard to hand size). Putting two back is refused (it is "one of those cards").

